It is not an error, it is a warning. As far as I can tell, everything
looks ok. The warning is produced by the 'summary()' function, and is
most likely just a side-effect of the way semTools (0.4-13) creates the
lavaan object. I would not worry about it. Future updates of semTools
will (most likely) not create lavaan objects, and use a custom summary()
function.

Yves.

